Personas
To support user-centred planning, the group defined two personas that represent
typical users of a community sharing platform. These personas were used during Sprint
1 to guide early design discussions and ensure the system is accessible, safe, and easy
to use.
Persona 1: Student Seeking Support or Shared Resources
Name: Calvin Souza
Age: 21
Role: University Student
Aspect Description
Goals Find shared resources or support, such as study help or temporary
access to items
Needs Simple navigation, clear listings, quick way to contact other users
Concerns Trust and safety when interacting with unknown users
Motivation Save time and access support within the student community
This persona influenced early planning decisions around simplicity, clarity of
information, and the need for responsible user interaction.
